    <p class="section-number">01</p>
    <h2>Introduction</h2>
    <p>
      These Terms of Service (the “Terms”) are an agreement between you and Richard Solomou (“I”,
      “me”), who operates RAS Connect as an individual. They govern your use of RAS Connect and of
      the RAS Code website. By signing in to RAS Connect you accept these Terms. If you do not accept
      them, do not sign in; the RAS Code software works without an account.
    </p>
    <p>
      You must be at least 13 years old, and old enough under the law where you live to enter into
      this agreement.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="software">
    <p class="section-number">02</p>
    <h2>The Software Is Separate From the Service</h2>
