      possible.
    </p>
    <p>
      Do not build anything you depend on around the continued availability of RAS Connect. RAS Code
      works without it: local network and self-operated tunnel connections need no hosted service at
      all, and the relay source is available if you would rather run it yourself.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="fees">
    <p class="section-number">08</p>
